<title>USA: Dayton Hudson Corp Q1 May 3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Dayton Hudson Corp Q1 May 3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shr primary		$0.45		    $0.17</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.44		    $0.16</p>
<p> Net			105,000		   41,000</p>
<p> Revs		   5,889,000		5,380,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     219,800		  217,800</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     231,700		  230,400</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1997 net is after charge of $21.0 million or $0.10 a share primary ($0.09 a share diluted) from redemption of debt, net of tax.  </p>
<p>Excluding charge, Q1 1997 net was $126.0 million or $0.55 a share primary ($0.53 diluted).</p>
<p>Year-ago Q1 results are after $1.0 million charge from redemption of debt.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
